{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220860/extras/34c01b00478814109045f65caadea6ff.poster.avif?t=1765293750\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220860/extras/34c01b00478814109045f65caadea6ff.webm?t=1765293750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220860/extras/34c01b00478814109045f65caadea6ff.mp4?t=1765293750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A side-scrolling action RPG in a beautiful 3D world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last battle is in 100 days. How you reach it, depends on the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201dCraft\u201d everything and beat the game how you want to.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slash through the army of enemies with countless swords in this action battle game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety and depth of customization: main character, sword, base, Imouto (sister), and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings that change depending on how you spend your 100 days.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201dCraft\u201d battles with this 1000 weapons action game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220860/extras/c32534e1ab284dcc7c4a34e456015a50.poster.avif?t=1765293750\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220860/extras/c32534e1ab284dcc7c4a34e456015a50.webm?t=1765293750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220860/extras/c32534e1ab284dcc7c4a34e456015a50.mp4?t=1765293750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack, move, defend and many more actions by the protagonist are done through its weapon. You start with one weapon. But through your days, you are able to use up to 1000 weapons. It is up to the player to decide which weapon, learned or acquired, is used for which action. &quot;Craft&quot; your own battles by mastering countless weapons in your own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201dCraft\u201d the 100 days in this story where choice &amp; decision is key!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220860/extras/741215252ad9151c364b5c746a017b98.poster.avif?t=1765293750\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220860/extras/741215252ad9151c364b5c746a017b98.webm?t=1765293750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220860/extras/741215252ad9151c364b5c746a017b98.mp4?t=1765293750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player can live however they want until the day of the last battle. They can become stronger through repeated battles, or they can take on powerful enemies from the beginning. They can even spend time in peace without fighting. Find YOUR best way to live each day and &quot;craft&quot; your own path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Ace in Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The power of the Tsurugi \u2014 a blade capable of rewriting fate itself!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220860/extras/5016adeb1394a72c9d34b278291cd039.poster.avif?t=1765293750\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220860/extras/5016adeb1394a72c9d34b278291cd039.webm?t=1765293750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the protagonist\u2019s signature ability, the player can wield the power of the Tsurugi to rewrite fate itself. With this power, you can transform items you\u2019ve obtained into entirely different ones, erase enemies before you as if they never existed, and even rewind time by rolling back the days that have already passed. It is, in every sense, a truly game-breaking force.<br>This ace in your hand can shatter the destiny laid out for the protagonist. Within the 100 day constraint, wield this fate bending power and craft a future that is uniquely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization / Ikusei</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Craft&quot; even your sister with the bonding sisters ikusei system!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles are supported by the protagonist's beloved sister, the only family. Pure and innocent, she can be royal or rebellious, depending on how the player interacts with her. She may become curious or a passionate scholar. &quot;Craft&quot; even your sister, through the days you spend time together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Director\uff1aYosuke Shiokawa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prominent works\uff1aFate/Grand Order, Kingdom Hearts, Dissidia: Final Fantasy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Design\uff1aKUROBOSHI KOUHAKU</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prominent works\uff1aSummon Night, Kino's Journey, Sword Art Online Alternative Gun Gale Online</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Composer\uff1aTakeharu Ishimoto</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prominent works\uff1aThe World Ends with You, Kingdom Hearts, Crisis Core: Final Fantasy VII</p></p></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2220860?t=1765293750","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2220860?t=1765293750","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220860/e2e5e9dc4c9e771c81ccad284bb30ebb4afb96a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765293750","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220860/e2e5e9dc4c9e771c81ccad284bb30ebb4afb96a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765293750","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220860/extras/34c01b00478814109045f65caadea6ff.poster.avif?t=1765293750\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220860/extras/34c01b00478814109045f65caadea6ff.webm?t=1765293750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220860/extras/34c01b00478814109045f65caadea6ff.mp4?t=1765293750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A side-scrolling action RPG in a beautiful 3D world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last battle is in 100 days. How you reach it, depends on the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201dCraft\u201d everything and beat the game how you want to.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slash through the army of enemies with countless swords in this action battle game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety and depth of customization: main character, sword, base, Imouto (sister), and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings that change depending on how you spend your 100 days.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201dCraft\u201d battles with this 1000 weapons action game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220860/extras/c32534e1ab284dcc7c4a34e456015a50.poster.avif?t=1765293750\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220860/extras/c32534e1ab284dcc7c4a34e456015a50.webm?t=1765293750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220860/extras/c32534e1ab284dcc7c4a34e456015a50.mp4?t=1765293750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack, move, defend and many more actions by the protagonist are done through its weapon. You start with one weapon. But through your days, you are able to use up to 1000 weapons. It is up to the player to decide which weapon, learned or acquired, is used for which action. &quot;Craft&quot; your own battles by mastering countless weapons in your own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201dCraft\u201d the 100 days in this story where choice &amp; decision is key!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220860/extras/741215252ad9151c364b5c746a017b98.poster.avif?t=1765293750\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220860/extras/741215252ad9151c364b5c746a017b98.webm?t=1765293750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220860/extras/741215252ad9151c364b5c746a017b98.mp4?t=1765293750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player can live however they want until the day of the last battle. They can become stronger through repeated battles, or they can take on powerful enemies from the beginning. They can even spend time in peace without fighting. Find YOUR best way to live each day and &quot;craft&quot; your own path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Ace in Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The power of the Tsurugi \u2014 a blade capable of rewriting fate itself!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220860/extras/5016adeb1394a72c9d34b278291cd039.poster.avif?t=1765293750\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220860/extras/5016adeb1394a72c9d34b278291cd039.webm?t=1765293750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the protagonist\u2019s signature ability, the player can wield the power of the Tsurugi to rewrite fate itself. With this power, you can transform items you\u2019ve obtained into entirely different ones, erase enemies before you as if they never existed, and even rewind time by rolling back the days that have already passed. It is, in every sense, a truly game-breaking force.<br>This ace in your hand can shatter the destiny laid out for the protagonist. Within the 100 day constraint, wield this fate bending power and craft a future that is uniquely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customization / Ikusei</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Craft&quot; even your sister with the bonding sisters ikusei system!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles are supported by the protagonist's beloved sister, the only family. Pure and innocent, she can be royal or rebellious, depending on how the player interacts with her. She may become curious or a passionate scholar. &quot;Craft&quot; even your sister, through the days you spend time together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Development Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Director\uff1aYosuke Shiokawa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prominent works\uff1aFate/Grand Order, Kingdom Hearts, Dissidia: Final Fantasy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Design\uff1aKUROBOSHI KOUHAKU</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prominent works\uff1aSummon Night, Kino's Journey, Sword Art Online Alternative Gun Gale Online</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Composer\uff1aTakeharu Ishimoto</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prominent works\uff1aThe World Ends with You, Kingdom Hearts, Crisis Core: Final Fantasy VII</p></p></p>","developers":["213\u2109"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220860/8031878e4afc0d73a9b446b93ae9aa614708888b/header.jpg?t=1765293750","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"